{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“旋量丛”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"旋量丛"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"旋量群","text":"旋量群"}},{"Plain":"的不可约表示通过"},{"Local":{"url":"关联丛","text":"关联丛"}},{"Plain":"的构造对应于基本的旋量丛.</p>\n<p>$4$ 维情形:\n$$\r\n\\mathbb{R}^{3+1}\\otimes \\mathbb{C} \\simeq \\underset{A}{\\mathbb{C}^2} \\otimes \\underset{A'}{\\widetilde {\\mathbb{C}}^2},\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\widetilde {SO_o(1,3)} \\simeq SL(2,\\mathbb{C})\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Weyl张量","text":"Weyl 张量"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"零迹Ricci张量","text":"零迹 Ricci 张量"}},{"Plain":"都对应某些表示.</p>\n<p>相关: "},{"Local":{"url":"twistor理论","text":"twistor 理论"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2>自旋度量</h2>\n<p>使用下标 $a=AA'$,\n$$\r\ng_{ab}=g_{AA'BB'}=\\epsilon_{AB}\\overline{\\epsilon_{A'B'}},\r\n$$\n$\\nabla_{BB'}\\Pi_A$ 在两个不可约表示上的分量分别为 $\\nabla_{B'(B}\\Pi_{A)}$ 与 $\\nabla_{B'B}\\Pi_A \\epsilon^{BA} = \\nabla_{B'}^{A}\\Pi_A$.</p>\n"}]}}